,{"h":"SC/UPC BOSA","c":[]},{"h":"12V 0.5A EU Type power adapter","c":[]},{"h":"WARRANTY: Twenty Four (24) months limited warranty.","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p>The ECOM <b>E511G-XP-F670</b> 1GE Single Port <a>XPON </a><a href=\"http://ttx-solution/onu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ONU</a><a> </a>is a universal FTTH solution that delivers high-speed, stable, and energy-efficient fiber connectivity. Supporting dual-mode EPON and GPON, this ONU ensures seamless compatibility with any brand OLT, including Huawei, VSOL, BDCOM, and C-DATA.</p><p><br></p><p>Designed for residential and small business networks, it features a single Gigabit Ethernet (1GE) port to provide ultra-fast internet suitable for 4K streaming, gaming, VoIP, and heavy data usage. With low power consumption (&lt;3.5W) and a DC 12V/0.5A power adapter, it operates efficiently while maintaining stable performance. The device uses an SC/APC optical connector for reliable and strong optical signal transmission.</p><p>Compact, easy to install, and ISP-friendly, the E511G-XP-F670 is the ideal ONU for Bangladeshi FTTH deployments.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li>XPON ONU supporting EPON &amp; GPON dual-mode</li><li>Fully compatible with Huawei, VSOL, BDCOM, C-DATA, and other OLT brands</li><li>1GE Gigabit Ethernet port for ultra-fast wired connectivity</li><li>SC/APC fiber connector for stable signal quality</li><li>Low power consumption (&lt;3.5W) with DC 12V/0.5A power adapter</li><li>Compact &amp; lightweight design for easy installation</li><li>Perfect for FTTH applications in home and office networks</li></ul><p><br></p>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"XPON ONU with 2GE & Dual Band WiFi FD512GD-R550","href":"/xpon-onu-wit